>YDR081C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:IV:607304:610081:-1 gene:YDR081C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:PDC2 description:Transcription factor for thiamine-regulated genes; required for expression of the two isoforms of pyruvate decarboxylase (PDC1 and PDC5) along with thiamine biosynthetic genes; binds a DNA sequence in the PDC5 promoter; mutant fails to grow on 2% glucose and thus is scored as inviable under standard conditions [Source:SGD;Acc:S000002488]
