>YBR034C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:II:304930:305976:-1 gene:YBR034C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:HMT1 description:Nuclear SAM-dependent mono- and asymmetric methyltransferase; modifies hnRNPs, including Npl3p and Hrp1p, affecting their activity and nuclear export; methylates U1 snRNP protein Snp1p, ribosomal protein Rps2p, and histones H3 and H4; interacts genetically with genes encoding components of Rpd3(L) and this interaction is important for Rpd3 recruitment to the subtelomeric region [Source:SGD;Acc:S000000238]
