>YDL022W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:IV:411825:413000:1 gene:YDL022W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:GPD1 description:NAD-dependent glycerol-3-phosphate dehydrogenase; key enzyme of glycerol synthesis, essential for growth under osmotic stress; expression regulated by high-osmolarity glycerol response pathway; protein abundance increases in response to DNA replication stress; constitutively inactivated via phosphorylation by the protein kinases Ypk1p and Ypk2p, dephosphorylation increases catalytic activity; forms a heterodimer with Pnc1p to facilitate its peroxisomal import [Source:SGD;Acc:S000002180]
