>YNL036W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:XIV:559814:560479:1 gene:YNL036W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:NCE103 description:Carbonic anhydrase; metalloenzyme that catalyzes CO2 hydration to bicarbonate, which is an important metabolic substrate, and protons; not expressed under conditions of high CO2, such as inside a growing colony, but transcription is induced in response to low CO2 levels, such as on the colony surface in ambient air; poorly transcribed under aerobic conditions and at an undetectable level under anaerobic conditions; abundance increases in response to DNA replication stress [Source:SGD;Acc:S000004981]
