>YOR026W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:XV:379781:380806:1 gene:YOR026W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:BUB3 description:Kinetochore checkpoint WD40 repeat protein; localizes to kinetochores during prophase and metaphase, delays anaphase in the presence of unattached kinetochores; forms complexes with Mad1p-Bub1p and with Cdc20p, binds Mad2p and Mad3p; functions at kinetochore to activate APC/C-Cdc20p for normal mitotic progression [Source:SGD;Acc:S000005552]
