>YOR242C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:XV:788742:789857:-1 gene:YOR242C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:SSP2 description:Sporulation specific protein that localizes to the spore wall; required for sporulation at a point after meiosis II and during spore wall formation; expression controlled by a tightly regulated middle-meiotic promoter that is activated by Ndt80p; translation of SSP2 mRNA is delayed, such that the mRNA is present as nuclear divisions are taking place but is not engaged by ribosomes until relatively late in meiotic development [Source:SGD;Acc:S000005768]
