>YGL181W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:VII:157906:159096:1 gene:YGL181W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:GTS1 description:Protein involved in Arf3p regulation and in transcription regulation; localizes to the nucleus and to endocytic patches; contains an N-terminal Zn-finger and ArfGAP homology domain, a C-terminal glutamine-rich region, and a UBA (ubiquitin associated) domain; gts1 mutations affect budding, cell size, heat tolerance, sporulation, life span, ultradian rhythms, endocytosis; expression oscillates in a pattern similar to metabolic oscillations [Source:SGD;Acc:S000003149]
