>YHL023C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:VIII:59123:62563:-1 gene:YHL023C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:NPR3 description:Subunit of the Iml1p/SEACIT complex; SEACIT (Iml1p-Npr2p-Npr3p) is a subcomplex of SEAC, a coatomer-related complex that associates dynamically with the vacuole; Npr3p may have a structural or regulatory role, supporting Iml1p function as a GAP for the Rag family GTPase Gtr1p, and leading to inhibition of TORC1 signaling in response to amino acid deprivation; SEACIT is required for non-nitrogen-starvation-induced autophagy; null mutant has meiotic defects; human NPRL3 homolog [Source:SGD;Acc:S000001015]
