>YNR018W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:XIV:664270:664944:1 gene:YNR018W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:RCF2 description:Cytochrome c oxidase subunit; has a role in assembly of respiratory supercomplexes; similar to Rcf1p, and either Rcf1p or Rcf2p is required for late-stage assembly of the Cox12p and Cox13p subunits and for cytochrome c oxidase activity; associates with the cytochrome c oxidase - cytochrome bc1 supercomplex; null mutant accumulates reactive oxygen species; member of the conserved hypoxia induced gene family; C. elegans homolog is functional in yeast [Source:SGD;Acc:S000005301]
