>YCL047C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:III:43661:44437:-1 gene:YCL047C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:POF1 description:Nicotinamide mononucleotide-specific adenylyltransferase (NMNAT); catalyzes the conversion of nicotinamide mononucleotide (NMN) to nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide (NAD+); role in the nicotinamide riboside (NR) salvage pathway of NAD+ biosynthesis; involved in NR and NAD+ homeostasis; ATPase involved in protein quality control and filamentation pathways; interacts physically with Kss1p and suppresses the filamentation defect of a kss1 deletion [Source:SGD;Acc:S000000552]
