>YLR022C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:XII:184174:184926:-1 gene:YLR022C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:SDO1 description:Guanine nucleotide exchange factor (GEF) for Ria1p; essential protein involved in ribosome maturation; with Ria1p, promotes release of Tif6p from 60S ribosomal subunits in the cytoplasm so that they can assemble with 40S subunits to generate mature ribosomes; ortholog of the human protein (SBDS) responsible for autosomal recessive Shwachman-Bodian-Diamond Syndrome; highly conserved across archaea and eukaryotes [Source:SGD;Acc:S000004012]
