>YER046W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:V:243180:243611:1 gene:YER046W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:SPO73 description:Meiosis-specific protein required for prospore membrane morphogenesis; required for the proper shape of the prospore membrane (PSM) and for spore wall formation; functions cooperatively with SPO71 in PSM elongation; physically interacts with Spo71p; genetically antagonistic to SPO1, similar to SPO71; localizes to the PSM; required for spore wall formation during sporulation; dispensable for both nuclear divisions during meiosis; dysferlin domain-only protein [Source:SGD;Acc:S000000848]
