>YBR201W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:II:623576:624211:1 gene:YBR201W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:DER1 description:ER membrane protein that promotes export of misfolded polypeptides; required for ER-associated protein degradation of misfolded or unassembled proteins; initiates export of aberrant polypeptides from ER lumen by threading them into ER membrane and routing them to Hrd1p for ubiquitination; function normally requires N-terminal acetylation by NatB; N- and C- termini protrude into cytoplasm; similar to Dfm1p; homolog of mammalian derlin-1 [Source:SGD;Acc:S000000405]
