>YIL121W_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:IX:132244:133872:1 gene:YIL121W gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:QDR2 description:Plasma membrane transporter of the major facilitator superfamily; member of the 12-spanner drug:H(+) antiporter DHA1 family; exports copper; has broad substrate specificity and can transport many mono- and divalent cations; transports a variety of drugs and is required for resistance to quinidine, barban, cisplatin, and bleomycin; contributes to potassium homeostasis; expression is regulated by copper [Source:SGD;Acc:S000001383]
