>YNL258C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:XIV:158109:160373:-1 gene:YNL258C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:DSL1 description:Peripheral membrane protein needed for Golgi-to-ER retrograde traffic; mediates Sey1p-independent homotypic ER fusion; forms Dsl1 tethering complex with Sec39p and Tip20p that forms a stable complex with ER SNAREs Sec20p, Ufe1p and Use1p and is functionally conserved from yeast to mammalian cells; component of the ER target site that interacts with coatomer; interacts with different subunits of COPI vesicle coat; interacts with Cin5p; homolog of fly and human ZW10 gene [Source:SGD;Acc:S000005202]
