>YMR039C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:XIII:348644:349522:-1 gene:YMR039C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:SUB1 description:Transcriptional regulator; facilitates elongation through factors that modify RNAP II; role in peroxide resistance involving Rad2p; role in nonhomologous end-joining (NHEJ) of ds breaks in plasmid DNA, but not chromosomal DNA; role in the hyperosmotic stress response through polymerase recruitment at RNAP II and RNAP III genes; negatively regulates sporulation; protein abundance increases in response to DNA replication stress; functionally complemented by human SUB1 (PC4) [Source:SGD;Acc:S000004642]
