>YJR104C_mRNA cds chromosome:R64-1-1:X:622550:623014:-1 gene:YJR104C gene_biotype:protein_coding transcript_biotype:protein_coding gene_symbol:SOD1 description:Cytosolic copper-zinc superoxide dismutase; detoxifies superoxide; stabilizes Yck1p and Yck2p kinases in glucose to repress respiration; phosphorylated by Dun1p, enters nucleus under oxidative stress to promote transcription of stress response genes; human ortholog SOD1 implicated in ALS complements a null allele; abundance increases under DNA replication stress and during exposure to boric acid; localization to mitochondrial intermembrane space is modulated by MICOS complex [Source:SGD;Acc:S000003865]
